      "mergedPostDetails": "Do the icons really have to be centered?\n\nRight now they cover the avatar image in a way that looks quite awkward. Since banner images are a paid customization feature, having them obscured like this defeats much of their purpose and makes them less appealing to purchase.\n\nI feel like I saw a similar Canny post before but couldn't find it, so I'm creating a new one.\n\nja:\n\ninviteやreq-invでアイコンがアバター/プロフィール画像を潰すのが不細工すぎる\n\nアイコンの配置は真ん中で無くても良いのでは……？\n\nバナー画像が課金要素なのにこれだと意味が無くなって課金したくも無くなると思います。\n\n似たcannyを見た気がしなくもないが見付からなかったのでたてます。",
